    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73405" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμᾰλ-ύνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμαλίζω</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1.1
			</span></i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν κονδύλωσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Haem.</u>
					5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				45e
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἄρουραν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1284a30
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>bring</i> the body <i>to an even temperature,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				381a20
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				1032b19
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>make regular,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ πνεῦμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antyll.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				6.5.1
			</span></i>.</div>
